/a></span>, 60 L. ed. &#8212;, 36 Sup. Ct. Rep. 12.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"num\" id=\"p2\">\n      <span class=\"num\">2</span>\n      <p class=\"indent\">Mr. Addison S. Pratt for appellant.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"num\" id=\"p3\">\n      <span class=\"num\">3</span>\n      <p class=\"indent\">Mr. Charles Fox for appellee.</p>\n    </div>\n    "}],"citations":[]}